{"member_key":"rs-2510","house":"Rajya Sabha","kind":"special_mentions","records":[{"title":"Demand for recognising Assemese script in ISO - 15924 and ISO/IEC-10646","date":"2023-07-26","details":[["Date","26/07/2023"],["Session","260"],["Ministry","CONSUMER AFFAIRS AND PUBLIC DISTRIBUTION"],["Statement","Shri Pabitra Margherita: In the August Parliament, I already appealed for recognizing Assamese\r\nas a classical language and subsequently Assam Publication Board. Asom Sahitya Sabha\r\nand Government of Assam are already working on it. Now I would like to appeal\r\nfor taking necessary steps to recognize Assamese script in ISO 15924-2004 and\r\nISO/IEC 10646. The origin of the Assamese script can be traced back to the\r\nearly decades of the fourth century. But unfortunately, in ISO and UNICODE\r\ndocuments and code chart, Assamese script has not been appropriately recognised. Earlier Assamese script was recognised\r\nby DIT (Meity) and C-DAC. In ISCII, the code for\r\nAssamese script was 57006. (ISCII) was the standard recognized by Government of\r\nIndia for the Indic scripts before Unicode standard was accepted. Bureau of\r\nIndian Standards (BIS) is one of the recognizing authorities of script code for\r\nIndian Languages. According to documentary evidence, BIS encoded Assamese\r\nscript independently for Assamese language in 1991. But in ISO/IEC 10646, which\r\nprovides a code for the representation of names of scripts, Assamese script is\r\nmissing. Similarly, in ISO/IEC 10646, which is related to Unicode, Assamese script\r\nis not recognized properly. I earnestly appeal for recognisation\r\nof Assamese script in ISO and Unicode. BIS has the authority to forward the\r\ndemand to ISO for recognising and encoding the\r\nAssamese script in its standards. Therefore, I request the concerned Government\r\nauthorities to take the necessary steps to ensure the recognisation\r\nof Assamese script in the National and International standards, thereby\r\npreserving the heritage.\n?(Ends)"],["Reply","No Reply"]],"links":[{"label":"Official source","url":"https://rsdoc.nic.in/memberGetdata/Get_SpecialMentionmemberwise?mpcode=2510"}]},{"title":"Demand to declare ostomy patients as specially abled i.e. “Divyang”","date":"2022-12-20","details":[["Date","20/12/2022"],["Session","258"],["Ministry","HEALTH AND FAMILY WELFARE"],["Statement","&#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2368;\r\n&#2346;&#2348;&#2367;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;\r\n&#2350;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2327;&#2375;&#2352;&#2367;&#2335;&#2366; (&#2309;&#2360;&#2350;):\r\n&#2350;&#2361;&#2379;&#2342;&#2351;, &#2350;&#2375;&#2352;&#2368;\r\n&#2310;&#2346;&#2360;&#2375; &#2321;&#2360;&#2381;&#2335;&#2379;&#2350;&#2368;\r\n&#2350;&#2352;&#2368;&#2332;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2342;&#2367;&#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2306;&#2327;\r\n&#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2339;&#2368; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;\r\n&#2354;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2357;&#2367;&#2344;&#2340;&#2368;\r\n&#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2332;&#2367;&#2344; &#2350;&#2352;&#2368;&#2332;&#2379;&#2306;\r\n&#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2354;-&#2350;&#2370;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;\r\n&#2350;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2327; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;\r\n&#2325;&#2376;&#2306;&#2360;&#2352;,\r\n&#2325;&#2379;&#2354;&#2366;&#2311;&#2335;&#2367;&#2360;\r\n&#2309;&#2354;&#2381;&#2360;&#2352; &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366;\r\n&#2361;&#2376;, &#2313;&#2344;&#2325;&#2375; &#2332;&#2368;&#2357;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368;\r\n&#2352;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375;\r\n&#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2319;&#2325; &#2358;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351;\r\n&#2330;&#2367;&#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2381;&#2360;&#2366;\r\n&#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2313;&#2344;&#2325;&#2366;\r\n&#2352;&#2375;&#2325;&#2381;&#2335;&#2350; &#2351;&#2366;\r\n&#2348;&#2381;&#2354;&#2376;&#2337;&#2352; &#2344;&#2367;&#2325;&#2366;&#2354;\r\n&#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;\r\n&#2324;&#2352; &#2346;&#2375;&#